---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const pageTitle = "About CountDays — Free & Ad-Free Date Calculator Tools";
const pageDescription = "Learn about CountDays, our publisher Harkle Digital, and our mission to build fast, ad-free, mathematically precise date tools.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
	<section class="mb-24 w-full prose dark:prose-invert" style="width:100%; max-width:800px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">
		<div class="prose-content w-full" style="width:100%;">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-link border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft mb-4">
				<span>About CountDays</span>
			</div>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-6" style="width:100%;">
				About CountDays
			</h1>
			<p class="text-xl text-body mb-8 leading-relaxed" style="width:100%;">
				CountDays is an independent digital utility platform dedicated to building the fastest, cleanest, and most mathematically precise date calculation tools on the web.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4 text-ink" style="width:100%;">Our Mission</h2>
			<p style="width:100%;">
				Most date calculators on the internet were built decades ago and are now bogged down by aggressive ad networks, slow popups, and outdated user interfaces. CountDays was engineered from the ground up by <strong>Harkle Digital</strong> to deliver instant, ad-free calendar math powered by modern static web technology.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4 text-ink" style="width:100%;">Mathematical Precision & Standards</h2>
			<p style="width:100%;">
				Our calculation algorithms adhere strictly to international Gregorian calendar standards:
			</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 my-4" style="width:100%;">
				<li><strong>Leap Year Handling:</strong> Quadrennial leap days (February 29th) are factored into all multi-year intervals according to standard astronomical rules.</li>
				<li><strong>Business Day Calculations:</strong> Working days strictly isolate Mondays through Fridays, providing reliable estimates for corporate project management and banking clearing windows.</li>
				<li><strong>UTC Date Normalization:</strong> All calculations operate on UTC timestamp boundaries to eliminate local timezone offset distortions.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4 text-ink" style="width:100%;">Privacy & Transparency First</h2>
			<p style="width:100%;">
				We believe utility calculators should respect user privacy. All calculations run client-side in your web browser. Your inputs (such as birth dates, contract start dates, or personal milestones) are never saved to external servers or sold to data brokers.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4 text-ink" style="width:100%;">Our Suite of Tools</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6 not-prose" style="width:100%;">
				<a href="/" class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-canvas border border-hairline hover:border-link transition-colors block">
					<h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-1">Days Between Dates</h3>
					<p class="text-xs text-mute">Calculate exact elapsed duration and business days between any two dates.</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/date-calculator/" class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-canvas border border-hairline hover:border-link transition-colors block">
					<h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-1">Date Offset Calculator</h3>
					<p class="text-xs text-mute">Add or subtract days, weeks, or months to find a target future or past date.</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/age-calculator/" class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-canvas border border-hairline hover:border-link transition-colors block">
					<h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-1">Exact Age Calculator</h3>
					<p class="text-xs text-mute">Compute age down to the live second, total days lived, and 10,000 days milestone.</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/business-days/" class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-canvas border border-hairline hover:border-link transition-colors block">
					<h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-1">Business Days Calculator</h3>
					<p class="text-xs text-mute">Count working days excluding weekends for payroll and project sprints.</p>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
		"@context": "https://schema.org",
		"@graph": [
			{
				"@type": "AboutPage",
				"name": pageTitle,
				"url": "https://www.countdaysbetween.com/about/",
				"description": pageDescription
			},
			{
				"@type": "Organization",
				"name": "Harkle Digital",
				"url": "https://www.countdaysbetween.com/",
				"logo": "https://www.countdaysbetween.com/favicon-96x96.png"
			}
		]
	})} />
</Layout>